    "Choose 3 to 5 topics and Fiscal puts them first. The numbers stay the same for everyone, and your lens never leaves this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escolha de 3 a 5 temas e o Fiscal coloca esses temas na frente. Os números são os mesmos para todo mundo, e a sua lente nunca sai deste aparelho."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose two politicians in Search and Fiscal puts their numbers side by side, with no score or ranking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
